  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Mine Action and Cluster Munitions Programme 2020-2024 - Global</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With support from the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs, MAG will implement Humanitarian Mine Action activities across Iraq, Lebanon and South Sudan from 2021-2024. Activities include survey and clearance, non-technical survey and explosive risk education, and capacity building activities with national stakeholders.</narrative>
